(Brazilian guitar w/echo)

Solo is played using a 7 string brazilian guitar,
so if you want to get the same sound of the song
you must tune down you guitar to: ADG...,

..or to buy a brazilian guitar, of course :-)

I've tabbed the intro an OCTAVE HIGHER,
to not be forced to change the tuning of the guitar.
Enjoy!

